00:10:27,272 --> 00:10:33,272
Green Zone is a war, action, adventure film directed by Paul Greengrass.

3
00:15:40,909 --> 00:15:46,909
During the U.S.-led occupation of Baghdad in 2003, Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller and his team of Army inspectors
are dispatched to find weapons of mass destruction believed to be stockpiled in the Iraqi desert.

4
00:20:54,545 --> 00:21:00,545
Rocketing from one booby-trapped and treacherous site to the next, the men search for deadly chemical agents but
stumble instead upon an elaborate cover-up that threatens to invert the purpose of their mission.

